# tds-utils-public.allow -- the paths published to 9atatimer/tds-utils-public.
#
# One path or glob per line, relative to the repository root. `#` starts a
# comment. No negation. A path that no line names is not published, and a
# line that matches no file at the released commit refuses the whole
# publication. Runbook: docs/ops/tds-public.md.
#
# The mirror carries the emacs configuration, for use on machines other than
# the owner's laptop (Issue#833): clone the mirror and link
# ~/.emacs.d to its emacs/dot.emacs.d. Nothing else is published until the
# owner adds it here.

emacs/dot.emacs.d/**
